# Team Roster

Source of truth for planning and estimation. Every planning command
(/CyclePlan, /PRDFeasibility, /Breakdown, /PRDSequence) loads this file.
Update it whenever someone joins, leaves, changes role, or demonstrably
levels up. Log every change in the Change Log at the bottom.

**What does each field mean and what should I update?** See README.md in
this folder — it explains every setting (capacity, velocity, proficiency,
descriptions), the math behind it, and the update recipe for each kind of
team change.

